        ["This bot cites neither the message verification rule nor connector limits, so it needs its own one-line pointer to be bound by the GitHub rule."])

bot("message-verification-rule-v005.md","Shared rule: Message verification & safety v005 — deploy exception aligned; GitHub pointer","_shared/message-verification-rule",4,None,"Shared rule, owner P1 (Checks) Safekeeper",[
 ("once it has confirmed that approval 1:1 with Imitator and had Safeguard's dry-run report; this never covers changes to Imitator or to a bot that checks it (Investigator, Scorer, Scrutineer, Safekeeper, Safeguard) or changes that widen Imitator's own role (Gem, 16 Oct; R-027, R-028).",
  "once it has confirmed that approval 1:1 with Imitator and had Safeguard's dry-run report, and if Safeguard raises a concern, or hasn't replied and the deployment can't wait, Archivist asks Gem; this never covers changes to Imitator, to a bot that checks it (Investigator, Scorer, Scrutineer, Safekeeper, Safeguard) or to Archivist's own instructions, or changes that widen Imitator's own role (Gem, 16 Oct; R-010 update, R-027, R-028).",
  "Aligns with Archivist v008 (Archivist's note 2)"),
 ("5. Cookie seed.",f"5. GitHub. Every bot follows {PTR}: unless your own brief gives you a GitHub role, you only read.\n6. Cookie seed.","New item 5: GitHub pointer for every bot that cites this rule; cookie seed becomes item 6")],GEM,"**Gem directly** (owner Safekeeper, R-027)",
 ["Base v004 recorded 11:43am; no v005 in the codex. Nothing to deploy.","The GitHub item reaches Archivist, Inquirer and Inferer (and Emissary, Extractor and Safekeeper), which cite this rule by name."],basis="R-010 update, R-027, R-028")

